@startuml PropORACLE_Ticket_Design
' Ticket design — dual card + publish (reality + known gaps)
' Render: PlantUML extension or https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml

title PropORACLE — Ticket design (Goblin-70 + mixer)

start
:Sport step8 workbooks;
:combined_slate_tickets.py --write-web;
note right
  Graded-main mixer / grade pool.
  Does not own live /tickets alone.
end note

if (Caller routes through\nInvoke-G70WriteWebStandalone?) then (yes)
  :build_goblin70_tickets.py --write-web\n(via Invoke-G70WriteWebStandalone);
  note right
    Day-ahead / 1AM / 5AM / MLB fill /
    late_fetch / refresh / Publish-LiveSite
    use the helper (Tee-Object fallback
    if Invoke-LoggedPwsh.ps1 missing).
  end note
else (no — known gap)
  :build_goblin70_tickets.py --write-web\n(direct py in run_daily.ps1 STEP D-G70);
  note right
    **Gap:** run_daily.ps1 still invokes py
    directly — not the standalone helper.
    Ordering/logging may diverge from
    the wrapped path.
  end note
endif

note right
  Goblin-70 groups **first**.
  Patch mixer **lines** from this fetch.
  Merge **full** graded-main pool under.
  Do not drop mixer groups that left the live board.
end note

fork
  :Goblin Power 3\n(all-Goblin);
fork again
  :Flex 4\n(all-Standard or 1 Std + Goblin leftovers);
fork again
  :YOLO Power 4/5/6\n(Diamond/Platinum seeds;\n**excluded from ticket WR / Income**);
end fork

:tickets_latest.json\n(disk: ui_runner/runtime/\nGitHub: ui_runner/templates/);

fork
  :run_live_payout_capture.ps1\n(N-correct floors);
fork again
  :scrub_goblin70_keep_live.py\n(interval keep revalidation);
  note right
    **Not on rebuild path.** Lightweight
    drop of published G70 legs that now
    fail keep gates (Mesa Jr. class).
    Off-board legs left alone.
    Registered via run_g70_keep_scrub.ps1.
  end note
end fork

:Publish-LiveSite.ps1 → origin/main;
:Railway GET /tickets\nrenders prebuilt JSON;

stop

note bottom
  **Gates (keep files can REPLACE the generic stack, not only add):**
  Baseline 70% engine: directional L5=5 + L10>=8 + D + cover.
  Keep-file overrides (examples):
  · MLB pitcher Goblins → L10-primary (not L5=5 stack)
  · MLB Standard → hard-banned on G70
  · CFB Pass Yards Goblin OVER → D is N/A (skipped)
  · Tennis / Soccer / CFB / WNBA → sport keep modules
  Payout figure = N-correct (Flex/Power), never 1st place.
  Checkout gate changes are not live until main_cp rebuild + Publish-LiveSite.
end note

@enduml
